Subject: [PATCH] WM: use compositor-owned input service boundary

Stock WMS keeps its callbacks and input operations. HostInputManagerBridge
preserves filtering and key fallback while Wayland owns physical devices.
The full Android InputManagerService starts unavailable evdev and hardware
controllers.

